Origin

This project grew out of HyperXAudioGuard by the same author, which solved the
same problem for one manufacturer's hardware. Parts of its source are carried
over and modified here.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Attribution

The example receiver protocol quoted in the documentation (HID usage page 0x1C0,
report id 0x0C, status byte [6]) was reverse engineered and documented by the
project platorp/HyperX-Cloud-III-3-S-Audio-Switcher, licensed under the MIT
License: https://github.com/platorp/HyperX-Cloud-III-3-S-Audio-Switcher

No source code from that project is included in this work. It appears here only
as documentation: a worked example of the configurable probe format, which this
software reads from its configuration file and does not hardcode.

